<title>PHILIPPINES: TABLE-Philippine T-bills secondary market rates.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Philippine T-bills secondary market rates.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are secondary market rates quoted by banks on Wednesday for Philippine government securities. The rates are indicative as maturities are slightly varying.</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
<p>  BANK		     RATES BID/OFFER PCT</p>
<p>			    3-mths	 6-mths	   1-year</p>
<p>Bank of America    13.90 /13.40  14.30 /13.80   14.70 /14.20</p>
<p>BPI		    14.00 /13.75  14.50 /14.00   15.00 /14.50</p>
<p>Citibank	     14.00 /13.375 14.25 /13.875  14.625/14.375</p>
<p>Hongkong Bank	14.25 /13.50  14.75 /14.00   15.125/14.50</p>
<p>Metrobank	    14.75 /13.60  14.875/14.00   15.00 /14.10</p>
<p>Multinational	13.75 /13.50  14.25 /13.875  14.625/14.25</p>
<p>PNB		    14.00 /13.50  14.25 /13.75   15.00 /14.40</p>
<p>StanChart	    14.25 /13.75  14.50 /14.00   15.00 /14.50</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
